title: '`pallet-broker`: test `process_revenue` ignored and dropped paths'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds tests for the three previously untested `process_revenue` outcomes: duplicate
      revenue for a known timeslice emits `HistoryIgnored` and leaves the record untouched,
      zero converted revenue emits `HistoryDropped`, and revenue with only system
      contributions pays out to the system and emits `HistoryDropped`. Test-only.

crates:
  - name: pallet-broker
    bump: none
